    "x1": 482,
    "y1": 1415
   },
   "text": "Between these cities of past and present lies the mystic city of the future, with its great cloud walls.\n\nIn Oberlin there are nearly two thousand young folk at study and at play. Working and playing beside them are a hundred colored boys and girls, and they all walk on sacred ground, on ground long since consecrated to racial equality and hatred of caste and slavery. Yet among these venerable ideals obtrudes the Present and it, with all its odd corners, must be builted into the future city.",
   "status": "ok",
